<h2>SOUTHERN UNION BASEBALL</h2>

<h3>2017 Players Who Transferred to a 4-year College in 2018</h3>

<ul>
	<li>Trevin Bolden Grambling University</li>
	<li>Wes Bucher University of West Georgia</li>
	<li>Cooper Criswell University of North Carolina</li>
	<li>Chase Hall Auburn University</li>
	<li>Jackson Hesterlee University of North Carolina</li>
	<li>Joey Jordan University of Louisiana-Monroe</li>
	<li>Javier Lopez Trevecca Nazarene University</li>
	<li>Lucas Maldonado University of Pittsburgh</li>
	<li>Jonathan McKinney Auburn University</li>
	<li>John Michael Reed University of Montevallo</li>
	<li>Connor Stephenson University of West Georgia</li>
	<li>Hunter Stubbs University of West Georgia</li>
	<li>Cody Willingham Jacksonville State University</li>
</ul>

